⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
321 calories 34g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Everything But The… Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener (or any 1:1 sugar substitute)
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 7g white chocolate chips
- 9g peanut butter cups
- 7g chocolate covered toffee
- 7g chocolate covered almonds
321 cal 27g C, 14g F, 34g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 24 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with chopped up mix-ins
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

